Mic 7:1 , The church, complaining of her small number
Mic 7:3 , and the general corruption
Mic 7:5 , puts her confidence not in man, but in God;
Mic 7:8 , She triumphs over her enemies;
Mic 7:14 , She prays to God;
Mic 7:15 , God comforts her by promises of confusion to her enemies;
Mic 7:18 , and by his mercies.
